{"id": 19180, "title": "Do you know?", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "do-you-know", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/19180_do-you-know.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["你知道吗？我家旁边有一所大学。这所大学有三万个学生，两千多名老师，是这个城市最好的学校。也因为我家在大学旁边，所以吃东西、买东西都很方便。周围有很多商店和饭馆，云南菜、四川菜、广东菜……你想吃什么就有什么。这个大学后面有一座山，很有名。很多人来这儿旅游，中国人、外国人都喜欢来这里爬山。因为我很喜欢爬山，也喜欢和不同的人聊天，所以我成为了一名导游，每天都很快乐。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["你知道嗎？我家旁邊有一所大學。這所大學有三萬個學生，兩千多名老師，是這個城市最好的學校。也因為我家在大學旁邊，所以吃東西、買東西都很方便。周圍有很多商店和飯館，雲南菜、四川菜、廣東菜……你想吃什麼就有什麼。這個大學後面有一座山，很有名。很多人來這兒旅遊，中國人、外國人都喜歡來這裡爬山。因為我很喜歡爬山，也喜歡和不同的人聊天，所以我成為了一名導遊，每天都很快樂。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["nǐ zhī dào ma？ wǒ jiā páng biān yǒu yī suǒ dà xué。 zhè suǒ dà xué yǒu sān wàn gè xué shēng， liǎng qiān duō míng lǎo shī， shì zhè gè chéng shì zuì hǎo de xué xiào。 yě yīn wèi wǒ jiā zài dà xué páng biān， suǒ yǐ chī dōng xi、 mǎi dōng xi dōu hěn fāng biàn。 zhōu wéi yǒu hěn duō shāng diàn hé fàn guǎn， Yún nán cài、 Sì chuān cài、 Guǎng dōng cài …… nǐ xiǎng chī shén me jiù yǒu shén me。 zhè gè dà xué hòu miàn yǒu yī zuò shān， hěn yǒu míng。 hěn duō rén lái zhè r lǚ yóu， Zhōng guó rén、 wài guó rén dōu xǐ huan lái zhè lǐ pá shān。 yīn wèi wǒ hěn xǐ huan pá shān， yě xǐ huan hé bù tóng de rén liáo tiān， suǒ yǐ wǒ chéng wéi le yī míng dǎo yóu， měi tiān dōu hěn kuài lè。"], "english_paragraphs": ["Did you know? There is a university next to my home. This university has 30,000 students and more than 2,000 teachers. It is the best school in the city. Also because my home is next to the university, eating and shopping are very convenient. There are many shops and restaurants around, including Yunnan food, Sichuan food, Cantonese food...you can have whatever you want. There is a mountain behind this university, which is very famous. Many people come here to travel, and both Chinese and foreigners like to come here to climb mountains. Because I like climbing mountains and chatting with different people, I became a tour guide and was happy every day."], "english_full": "Did you know? There is a university next to my home. This university has 30,000 students and more than 2,000 teachers. It is the best school in the city. Also because my home is next to the university, eating and shopping are very convenient. There are many shops and restaurants around, including Yunnan food, Sichuan food, Cantonese food...you can have whatever you want. There is a mountain behind this university, which is very famous. Many people come here to travel, and both Chinese and foreigners like to come here to climb mountains. Because I like climbing mountains and chatting with different people, I became a tour guide and was happy every day.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nǐ\" data-defn=\"you\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">你</span><span class=\"tr\">你</span><rt>nǐ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhī dào\" data-defn=\"to know; to become aware of\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">知道</span><span class=\"tr\">知道</span><rt>zhī dào</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ma\" data-defn=\"(question particle for &quot;yes-no&quot; questions)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">吗</span><span class=\"tr\">嗎</span><rt>ma</rt></ruby>？<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"jiā\" data-defn=\"home / family / (polite) my (sister, uncle etc)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">家</span><span class=\"tr\">家</span><rt>jiā</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"páng biān\" data-defn=\"side; adjacent place\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2\"><span class=\"si\">旁边</span><span class=\"tr\">旁邊</span><rt>páng biān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu\" data-defn=\"to have; there is\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HS